{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577580/extras/EmojisBattle1Banner13MB.gif?t=1746263374\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Emojis Battle</strong>, you will battle against the renowned <strong>Bluemojis</strong> to save your kingdom. Take on the role of the <strong>Yellow Emojis</strong> and triumph in this year-long conflict between the <strong>Blue</strong> and <strong>Yellow Emojis</strong>, ignited by the king of the once-united lands refusing to grant the <strong>Bluemojis</strong> their own national day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Freedom of Choice:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577580/extras/Description1Gif13MB.gif?t=1746263374\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No boundaries! Assemble your own army of <strong>Yellow Emojis</strong> to match your strategy. Choose their weapons and lead them into battle against the <strong>Bluemojis</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Bluemojis:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577580/extras/Description2DemoGif18MB.gif?t=1746263374\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful\u2014there are over <strong>15 </strong>different types of <strong>Bluemojis</strong>, each excelling in unique ways and growing stronger with every round!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Diversity:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577580/extras/DescriptionDemo3Gif24MB.gif?t=1746263374\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle across diverse maps, each presenting unique challenges shaped by <strong>nature</strong>, <strong>time</strong>, and <strong>terrain</strong>, while expanding your army with new recruits as the war progresses!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unpredictable Situations:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577580/extras/Description4DemoGif17MB.gif?t=1746263374\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beware\u2014the <strong>Bluemojis</strong> are constantly coming up with new strategies and weapons to overpower you. With their ever-evolving tactics and mechanics, every encounter presents an unexpected surprise!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Updates:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Emojis Battle</strong> is a live game that will continuously receive updates, introducing new maps, <strong>Bluemojis</strong>, <strong>Yellow Emojis</strong>, upgrades, and much more!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3577580?t=1746263374","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3577580?t=1746263374","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577580/89877844d5849b0155ce35542652353caa9ceafd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746263374","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577580/89877844d5849b0155ce35542652353caa9ceafd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746263374","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577580/extras/EmojisBattle1Banner13MB.gif?t=1746263374\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Emojis Battle</strong>, you will battle against the renowned <strong>Bluemojis</strong> to save your kingdom. Take on the role of the <strong>Yellow Emojis</strong> and triumph in this year-long conflict between the <strong>Blue</strong> and <strong>Yellow Emojis</strong>, ignited by the king of the once-united lands refusing to grant the <strong>Bluemojis</strong> their own national day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Freedom of Choice:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577580/extras/Description1Gif13MB.gif?t=1746263374\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No boundaries! Assemble your own army of <strong>Yellow Emojis</strong> to match your strategy. Choose their weapons and lead them into battle against the <strong>Bluemojis</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Bluemojis:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577580/extras/Description2DemoGif18MB.gif?t=1746263374\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful\u2014there are over <strong>15 </strong>different types of <strong>Bluemojis</strong>, each excelling in unique ways and growing stronger with every round!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Diversity:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577580/extras/DescriptionDemo3Gif24MB.gif?t=1746263374\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle across diverse maps, each presenting unique challenges shaped by <strong>nature</strong>, <strong>time</strong>, and <strong>terrain</strong>, while expanding your army with new recruits as the war progresses!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unpredictable Situations:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577580/extras/Description4DemoGif17MB.gif?t=1746263374\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beware\u2014the <strong>Bluemojis</strong> are constantly coming up with new strategies and weapons to overpower you. With their ever-evolving tactics and mechanics, every encounter presents an unexpected surprise!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Updates:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Emojis Battle</strong> is a live game that will continuously receive updates, introducing new maps, <strong>Bluemojis</strong>, <strong>Yellow Emojis</strong>, upgrades, and much more!</p>","developers":["SYC"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3429940","name":"Emojis Battle"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577580/c4f75195a54955a281b6ecf3a6f685ce4e358218/header.jpg?t=1746263374","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257134583,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134583/movie480.mp4?t=1746263369","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134583/movie_max.mp4?t=1746263369"},"name":"Demo Gameplay V1 Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257134583/ad348f7e6764bac1c9c6904f5809e45529833913/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746263369","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134583/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746263369","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134583/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746263369"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257132697,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132697/movie480.mp4?t=1746084861","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132697/movie_max.mp4?t=1746084861"},"name":"Demo Gameplay Trailer V2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257132697/80d7dbf63bfd39f5a049cd6a9674b03dc270cc7e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746084861","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132697/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746084861